---
to: slide-facts.md
rendered: >
  PREFIX cs: <urn:xaas:case-study:>
  SELECT ?slide ?claimId ?standing ?claimText ?evidencePath WHERE {
    ?slide cs:rendersClaim ?claim .
    ?claim a cs:Claim ; cs:claimId ?claimId ; cs:standing ?standing ; cs:claimText ?claimText .
    OPTIONAL { ?claim cs:supportedBy ?evidence . ?evidence cs:evidencePath ?evidencePath }
  } ORDER BY ?slide ?claimId
emptySlides: >
  PREFIX cs: <urn:xaas:case-study:>
  SELECT ?slide ?noClaimReason WHERE {
    ?slide cs:noClaimReason ?noClaimReason .
  } ORDER BY ?slide
unrendered: >
  PREFIX cs: <urn:xaas:case-study:>
  SELECT ?claimId ?standing WHERE {
    ?claim a cs:Claim ; cs:claimId ?claimId ; cs:standing ?standing .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?claim cs:renderedBy ?anySlide }
  } ORDER BY ?claimId
---
# Slide facts projection (stub)

Generated from the case-study claims ledger via the cs: projection
conventions (cs:rendersClaim / cs:renderedBy / cs:noClaimReason). Failed
edge recorded 2026-09-25: no pptx-presentation-pack (pres:) exists in this
marketplace, so this stub consumes the seed conventions directly; a future
presentation pack can map cs:Projection to pres:Projection without touching
the ledger. Gate 030 guarantees this projection adds no claim: every slide
fact below resolves to a declared claim; slides without claims carry only
their cs:noClaimReason.

